  "mapLive": true,
  "_about": "BMW iDrive 7 Live Cockpit with the speed on the left, the revs on the right and the map between them, measured on a photo of a G-series cluster (generated by design/gen_strada.py: edit that and run it). One mview effect layer draws the black backdrop, both scales (outer line traced off the photo, the right one mirrored; BMW's numbered marks are not even along the line, so each number's mark is a spoke from the line in towards it and a value goes between its two marks), the needles, the red glow, the red zone, the dark panels, the fuel and oil dials and the tyre block's cross and car; the numbers and readouts are text widgets. Not drawn, for want of a signal: the speed limit sign and the street name. Widget reference: shared/hud.js header.",
